# 2T_1

@stopBgm fade:1 !wait
@bgm respite
@back bg_innDay
NA: You wake slowly, shifting in bed, the air already warm.
NA: The morning sun is rising, bringing heat with it.
NA: Your eyes blink up at the low ceiling. Dark wooden beams stretch overhead, and the scent of clean cloth and old smoke seeps into everything, filling the space around you.
NA: For a moment, you don’t understand where you are. You sit up abruptly.
@char {PLAYER}2.surprise look:left pos:{mid}
PLAYER: …no.
NA: You run your hands over your face, trying to fully wake up.
PLAYER: It was a dream… it has to be.
NA: But your clothes are neatly folded over a chair that isn’t yours. Your sneakers, stained with red dirt, sit beside it.
NA: There’s no sound of cars, no distant chatter carried through walls, no electricity humming in the background.
NA: Reality settles in, piece by piece.
PLAYER: I’m still here…
NA: You look around, uneasy.
NA: No bathroom. No sink. Nothing you’d recognize as basic comfort.
@char {PLAYER}2.thinking look:left pos:{mid}
PLAYER: How do people even live like this…?
NA: You run your hands through your hair.
PLAYER: I at least need to wash my face… honestly, a shower would be amazing right now.
NA: After a moment of hesitation, you stand.
NA: Your clothes still carry dust from the day before.
NA: You put them on anyway.
NA: Then head downstairs.
NA: The inn’s common room is simple, but welcoming.
NA: A woman stands by the counter, organizing clay containers.
NA: She looks up as you approach. Her eyes are attentive, but not unfriendly.
@char {PLAYER}2.thinking look:left pos:{leftmid}
@char FR.neutral look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: Well now… awake already.
NA: She studies you with curiosity.
FR: Did you sleep well?
@char {PLAYER}2.neutral look:left pos:{leftmid}
PLAYER: Better than I expected.
NA: She nods, satisfied.
FR: I am Francisca. This house is mine.
FR: And for now… it is yours as well.
PLAYER: Thank you… for letting me stay.
NA: She shrugs lightly.
@char FR.thinking look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: Every soul needs shelter at some point.
NA: Her gaze lingers on your hands, your face, your clothes.
@char FR.thinking look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: There is water out back, if you wish to wash.
FR: It is no luxury… but it will do.

NA: You smile without meaning to, as if your prayers had just been answered.
@char {PLAYER}2.smile look:left pos:{leftmid}
PLAYER: That already helps a lot.
@hideChars
NA: You head to the back in quick steps.
NA: There, a large basin of water waits.
NA: You dip your hands in, your body reacting instantly to the cold.
@char {PLAYER}2.surprise look:left pos:{mid}
PLAYER: Whoa!
NA: You do your best to clean up.
NA: No toothbrush. No modern soap. Just a jug and a few cloths.
NA: After a while, you return to the kitchen.
NA: Your skin is cold, your clothes slightly damp, your hair still wet.
NA: On the table, there’s simple food.
NA: Thick bread, broa, fruit… and a mug of something warm.
@char {PLAYER}2.surprise look:left pos:{leftmid}
@char FR.neutral look:left pos:{rightmid}
NA: Francisca notices your gaze.
@char {PLAYER}2.thinking look:left pos:{leftmid}
