NA: You sit, take a bite of the bread and pause.
NA: It tastes like pão de queijo.
NA: A soft, involuntary sound of pleasure slips past your lips.
@char {PLAYER}2.smile look:left pos:{leftmid}
PLAYER: It’s been a while since I had something like this.
NA: Francisca watches with a faint smile.
@char FR.smile look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: Hunger improves any table.
NA: She studies you more carefully now.
@char FR.thinking look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: Doctor Alvarenga brought you here.

@char {PLAYER}2.neutral look:left pos:{leftmid}
PLAYER: He did.
FR: He is a man of good nature.
NA: She hesitates, choosing her words.
@char FR.determined look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: Though his ideas… tend to bring him danger.
NA: You pause, watching her for a moment, weighing whether to speak.
@char {PLAYER}2.thinking look:left pos:{leftmid}
PLAYER: Are you talking about his ideas of change… or revolution?
NA: She takes a slight step back.
@char FR.angry look:left pos:{rightmid}
FR: Some words are best spoken softly.
@char {PLAYER}2.neutral look:left pos:{leftmid}
