NA: But he does not seem bothered.
@char TI.neutral look:left pos:{rightmid}
TI: Do not be embarrassed.
NA: He approaches with unhurried steps.
TI: This house lacks comfort… but it is rich in unrest.
NA: There is tiredness on his face.
NA: More visible now, in the morning light.
@char TI.thinking look:left pos:{rightmid}
