@shake Camera count:1
@char {PLAYER}2.surprise look:left pos:{leftmid}
NA: The sharp sound of glass shattering echoes far too loudly in the room, water spilling across the packed earth floor.
NA: The fragments glint in the light from the window.
NA: You startle at the noise.
PLAYER: I…
NA: The words die before they are born.
NA: Tiradentes reacts at once, turning toward the door, alert to the outside.
NA: Then he looks back at you.
NA: And smiles, realizing it was only you who knocked the glass over.
@char TI.smile look:left pos:{rightmid}
TI: I believe the water suffered more than you did.
NA: He crouches without ceremony and begins gathering the larger shards.
@char TI.neutral look:left pos:{rightmid}
